OL,3,GNEWSANuclear test veteran calls for
OL,4,A'truth and justice'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) has for
OL,7,Fdecades denied it covered up the
OL,8,Fradiation impacts but the prime
OL,9,Fminister announced this week a new
OL,10,Finquiry would get veterans "the full
OL,11,Ftruth".
